Tell your doctor about all your current medicines. Many drugs can affect omeprazole, especially:
- digoxin;
- clopidogrel;
- methotrexate;
- St. John's wort;
- a diuretic or "water pill"; or
- an antibiotic - amoxicillin, clarithromycin, rifampin.

